  "description": "Infrastructure layer for ECCO Communication Manager containing data access, external service integrations, messaging, health checks, and infrastructure implementations. Includes EF Core repositories, Azure integrations (Key Vault, Service Bus, SQL), PGP encryption, VentureFusion API client, NServiceBus routing, and comprehensive health monitoring.",
