  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.1-Beta (Initial Release)\n\t\t  - EF Core 9.0 repositories with SQL Server and Managed Identity authentication\n\t\t  - CorrespondenceDBContext with fluent API entity configurations\n\t\t  - Repository implementations (CorrespondenceRequest, RoutingConfiguration, DocumentIds, StatusHistory)\n\t\t  - Azure Key Vault integration with in-memory caching (SecretsCacheService)\n\t\t  - PGP encryption service using BouncyCastle for sensitive data\n\t\t  - VentureFusion API client with OAuth 2.0 bearer token authentication\n\t\t  - NServiceBus routing slip forwarder for sequential message processing\n\t\t  - Health checks for Azure SQL, Key Vault, and Service Bus\n\t\t  - Document ID generator service with atomic assignment\n\t\t  - Correspondence filter service with encrypted policy number search\n\t\t  - Managed Identity support for all Azure services\n\t\t  - Log injection prevention and security best practices",
